cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Garuda: Grid And Renewable Utilization & Deployment Analysis"
abstract: >-
  A sub-national, open-source energy-transition platform for Indonesia: a zonal
  capacity-expansion and operational model in Julia (JuMP) with a Python tooling
  layer, resolving the power system from islands to grid zones to individual
  village and industrial sites, and running end-to-end on the open-source HiGHS
  solver.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Power-Lab/garuda"
authors:
